    "en": {
      "text": "This gun has a unique version of Rampage that deals more damage in PvE. \n\nKills grant one stack each. Maximum of 3 Stacks. Stacks expire one at a time every 4.5 seconds.\n\nBonus damage granted at 1|2|3 stacks:\n<pve PvE: 20%|41%|66% />\n<pvp PvP: 10%|21%|33.1% />",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-17T00:50:21.082Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
